orm POVM defect bounds, and the eight-element `21/32` scalar result in a\n  new module `MIPStarRE/QPBT/Combining/QuadraticPointObstruction.lean`\n  (eleven unique declarations retained, statements unchanged).\n- Reuse merged PR #299's deterministic measurement and effect APIs\n  (`deterministicMeasurement`, `deterministicMeasurement_projective` in\n  `Test/Completeness/HonestStrategy/MeasurementFamily.lean`, and\n  `Measurement.postprocess_comp`) instead of the three generic duplicates the\n  saved packet carried. No shared-helper move, no import cycle, and no change\n  to `Combining/Apply.lean`, `PointErrorObstruction.lean`, the paper mirrors or\n  the blueprint chapters.\n- Archive PR #547's original cost and audit record byte-for-byte (116-line,\n  6524-byte suffix) under a valid YAML header in\n  `audits/2026-09-12_issue511-independent-finite-obstruction.md`.\n- Add a limited current-status cross-reference to the existing paper-gap note\n  `docs/paper-gaps/qpbt_combined-lines-error-term.tex`.\n\nScope is deliberately narrow: these are auxiliary, formalization-only\nobstruction results. No full line-law transport, no source theorem, and no\nblueprint `\\leanok` is claimed; the `21/256` X-axis mixture contribution stays\nprose, and the three open `Apply.lean` statements are untouched.\n\n## Testing\n\n- `lake env lean MIPStarRE/QPBT/Combining/QuadraticPointObstruction.lean` and\n  `lake env lean MIPStarRE/QPBT.lean`: pass.\n- `lake build MIPStarRE.QPBT.Combining.QuadraticPointObstruction`: passes,\n  re-verified after this branch was updated onto current main.\n- Fresh axiom probes: all preserved theorems reduce to exactly\n  `[propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]`, with no `sorryAx`. The module\n  contains no `sorry`, `axiom`, `admit`, `native_decide` or unsafe bypass.\n- Paper-gap lint, blueprint citation resolution and blueprint Lean sync: pass.\n- Installed pre-commit and pre-push gates: pass.\n\n---\n\nAddresses issue #511 without closing it; issue #511 and PR #547 stay open until\nthis replacement is integrated.\n", "created_at": "2026-09-18T02:42:48Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T02:49:59Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": "f221d6b18c9304b5a97a1cd1f3fe9df6ec022f79", "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "labels": [{"id": 12025010884, "node_id": "LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8axA", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/formalization", "name": "formalization", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": "Lean formalization of a mathematical statement", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "milestone": null, "draft": false, "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/587/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/587/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/issues/587/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/statuses/6d79bfcffb209e6ee30df907146671a0b719a95c", "head": {"label": "Dengnifer:issue-511-preserve-quadratic-obstruction-20260918", "ref": "issue-511-preserve-quadratic-obstruction-20260918", "sha": "6d79bfcffb209e6ee30df907146671a0b719a95c", "user": {"login": "Dengnifer", "id": 89234078, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg5MjM0MDc4", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89234078?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer", "html_url": "https://github.com/Dengnifer", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/subscriptions", "organ